# Roadmap

The project is still fairly young, so this list will probably change over time.

### 2D

* [ ] Collision with offset
* [ ] Circles
* [ ] Ellipses
* [ ] Rotation
* [ ] Scale
* [ ] Translation
* [ ] Clipping
* [ ] Alpha blending
* [ ] Other compositing modes
* [ ] RGB / HSV / HSL
* [ ] Interpolation
* [ ] Bilinear sampling
* [ ] Bicubic sampling, possibly

### Images

* [ ] BMP
* [ ] PNG
* [ ] JPEG
* [ ] Format conversion

### Other

* [ ] Audio
* [ ] Video
* [ ] Improve type and size handling
* [ ] Rework header organization
* [ ] Improve error handling
* [ ] Add more debugging tools

### Memory management

I'd also like to experiment with a more convenient way of handling allocations.

The idea is to keep track of surfaces allocated by the application and automatically free any that are still allocated when the application exits.

For temporary surfaces, another list could be used to automatically free them after a few frames.

---

## 3D

The project will eventually evolve to support 3D objects such as:

* Cameras
* Geometric shapes
* Meshes
* Assets

The goal is to keep the 2D and 3D APIs as consistent as possible.
